{
  "_conventions": "Mocked crypto: encryptWithMasterKey(v) is 'enc:' + v (null when v contains FAILENC), computeSHA256(v) is 'sha:' + v, decryptWithMasterKey('enc:<plain>') is <plain> (anything else fails). Transfer payloads use created_at 2026-01-02T03:04:05.000Z. Placeholders only; no real tokens.",
